-------------+----------------------------------------------------------------
   outdegree |  -2.697225   .1121093   -24.06   0.000    -2.916956   -2.477495
 reciprocity |   2.465242     .19969    12.35   0.000     2.073857    2.856627
   transtrip |   .6289044   .0714796     8.80   0.000     .4888069     .769002
