. 
. * ---------------------------------------------------------------
. * Part 2: missing data. Pupils 8 and 9 did not answer in wave 2:
. * their nominations are unknown (missnet), and so are their alcohol
. * values (missbeh).
. * ---------------------------------------------------------------
. mata:
------------------------------------------------- mata (type end to exit) --------------------------
: M2 = J(50, 50, 0)

: M2[8::9, .] = J(2, 50, 1)

: _diag(M2, 0)

: st_matrix("miss1", J(50, 50, 0))

: st_matrix("miss2", M2)

: st_matrix("miss3", J(50, 50, 0))

: end
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

. generate byte mb1 = 0

. generate byte mb2 = inlist(_n, 8, 9)

. generate byte mb3 = 0

. 
. nwsaom, waves(glasgow1 glasgow2 glasgow3) outdegree reciprocity transtrip missnet(miss1 miss2 miss
> 3) seed(4)
